WEBVTT

01:40.040 --> 01:43.960
HENING GATE

01:45.000 --> 01:46.640
You shouldn't have talked back to Wanning.

01:46.720 --> 01:48.000
You should've informed me first.

01:48.080 --> 01:49.680
It would have been too late.

01:50.280 --> 01:51.800
Shen Yurong cannot be injured or die

01:51.880 --> 01:54.120
at that night's palace feast
known by everyone in the city.

01:54.200 --> 01:56.360
Wanning would never endure this insult.

01:56.440 --> 01:59.440
Don't think she won't do anything to you.
She may have long wanted to do that.

01:59.520 --> 02:00.560
That's great.

02:00.640 --> 02:01.960
I want to see

02:02.520 --> 02:04.200
in what way she will act against me.

02:04.280 --> 02:05.640
She might not rule out killing you.

02:07.440 --> 02:08.360
I will be careful.

02:09.000 --> 02:10.759
GOVERN PEOPLE, SERVE THE HEAVENS

02:10.840 --> 02:11.720
Xiao Heng.

02:14.480 --> 02:15.440
If you were gone,

02:17.480 --> 02:19.360
I can't trust anyone around me anymore.

02:21.680 --> 02:22.640
Your Majesty,

02:22.720 --> 02:24.800
a trusted subordinate is used
to doing the dirty work.

02:24.880 --> 02:26.040
It's unavoidable to get hurt.

02:26.960 --> 02:27.840
But rest assured.

02:28.360 --> 02:29.200
I won't die.

02:47.080 --> 02:48.040
Your Highness.

02:48.120 --> 02:49.480
Last night, Zhennv Hall's chief

02:49.560 --> 02:51.600
was sent to Hui City's prison
thousands of miles away.

02:51.680 --> 02:52.800
There is no news for now.

02:53.600 --> 02:55.240
- You may go.
- Yes, Your Highness.

02:55.320 --> 02:57.600
KILL AT ONCE

03:01.360 --> 03:02.320
Meixiang,

03:02.960 --> 03:04.200
send this to the Li Residence.

03:05.240 --> 03:06.200
Yes, Your Highness.

03:13.760 --> 03:17.360
Shen Yurong,
what are you being so fussy about?

03:18.800 --> 03:20.160
You have a lot of nerve.

03:20.240 --> 03:22.080
How dare you embarrass me in public!

03:22.160 --> 03:24.520
Doesn't Your Highness think
you're too absurd at times?

03:25.520 --> 03:27.120
His Majesty organized that feast.

03:27.200 --> 03:29.240
If any of the students got injured
instead of me,

03:29.320 --> 03:31.080
Your Highness will be punished
by His Majesty.

03:31.160 --> 03:32.720
No matter
how Your Highness dislikes Jiang Li,

03:32.800 --> 03:34.600
you shouldn't humiliate yourself.

03:35.160 --> 03:36.600
How dare you talk back to me!

03:39.280 --> 03:40.120
Maids!

03:40.200 --> 03:41.200
Forget it!

03:42.320 --> 03:44.200
Isn't this what you want?

03:44.280 --> 03:45.200
What do you mean?

03:45.280 --> 03:46.480
You want me dead!

03:47.200 --> 03:48.040
That's nonsense.

03:48.120 --> 03:48.960
Wanning!

03:49.040 --> 03:50.680
Do not put yourself at risk again

03:50.760 --> 03:52.040
just to test Jiang Li.

03:52.840 --> 03:54.280
I cannot protect you all the time.

03:54.840 --> 03:56.040
I already killed her.

03:56.120 --> 03:57.720
I even went back to Qingcheng Mountain

03:58.920 --> 04:00.400
to the place where I buried her

04:01.400 --> 04:04.560
and saw her corpse
buried in the mud with my own eyes.

04:04.640 --> 04:07.920
But don't you find it strange that those
from Zhennv Hall just disappeared?

04:08.880 --> 04:09.880
Something is fishy.

04:09.960 --> 04:10.800
So what?

04:12.400 --> 04:13.600
I am by Your Highness's side.

04:21.959 --> 04:23.240
Your Highness, can you tell me

04:24.560 --> 04:25.760
what I should do

04:26.960 --> 04:28.240
to put your mind at ease?

04:29.200 --> 04:30.240
All right.

04:31.600 --> 04:33.560
You look so pitiful.

04:35.600 --> 04:37.760
I won't make you kneel
as punishment tonight.

04:39.360 --> 04:40.960
Dress your wound well.

04:41.840 --> 04:44.680
I'll wash you up tonight.

05:03.120 --> 05:06.440
HENING GATE

05:10.200 --> 05:11.040
Your Majesty,

05:14.080 --> 05:16.360
did you discuss national affairs
until this hour again?

05:19.240 --> 05:20.080
Yes.

05:24.640 --> 05:27.440
That's why I have come here
to relax and unwind.

05:27.520 --> 05:28.480
Come here.

05:28.560 --> 05:30.040
I will give you a massage.

05:36.640 --> 05:37.480
Your Majesty,

05:38.000 --> 05:40.240
I wish to go to Tianxiang Temple
in a few days

05:40.320 --> 05:41.560
to worship for a period of time.

05:41.640 --> 05:43.320
Why do you want to go there
all of a sudden?

05:43.400 --> 05:45.640
I just thought of Empress Dowager Xia.

05:45.720 --> 05:47.160
At this time before,

05:47.240 --> 05:50.120
she would always stay and pray
at Tianxiang Temple for blessings.

05:50.200 --> 05:52.920
Now, I also wish to go and take a look

05:53.000 --> 05:54.640
and also fulfill my filial duty.

05:55.560 --> 05:57.080
Thank you for the thought.

05:58.200 --> 05:59.520
After Mother's demise,

06:00.320 --> 06:02.400
you were the only one who went to me.

06:03.000 --> 06:04.320
If it weren't for you,

06:05.560 --> 06:07.600
I might never taste

06:07.680 --> 06:10.080
Mother's glutinous rice balls
in sweet rice wine again.

06:10.160 --> 06:11.440
You still remember.

06:12.200 --> 06:14.360
I love children the most.

06:14.840 --> 06:17.480
Back then,

06:18.080 --> 06:19.600
it was comforting

06:19.680 --> 06:21.600
to me.

06:42.080 --> 06:42.920
Road.

06:43.000 --> 06:44.600
- This word is "road."
- Road.

06:45.280 --> 06:46.400
This word is "light."

06:46.480 --> 06:47.360
- Jiang Li!
- Light.

06:49.160 --> 06:50.640
I know you're feeling down,

06:50.720 --> 06:53.040
so I brought my favorite snacks for you.

06:53.120 --> 06:54.640
Who says I am feeling down?

06:54.720 --> 06:55.960
Stop pretending.

06:56.040 --> 06:57.680
Something huge happened at Wanfeng Hall.

06:57.760 --> 06:58.920
How can I not know about it?

06:59.000 --> 07:01.240
Things will be tough for you now.

07:01.320 --> 07:02.200
Young Master,

07:02.280 --> 07:03.440
why are you always sarcastic?

07:04.760 --> 07:06.200
He did not say anything wrong.

07:06.280 --> 07:08.360
No matter what conflicts
we had in the past,

07:08.440 --> 07:10.160
it was fine on the surface.

07:10.240 --> 07:12.800
But after last night,
we totally had a falling-out.

07:16.520 --> 07:17.360
Jiang Li,

07:18.000 --> 07:19.320
what will you do now?

07:20.200 --> 07:22.000
Go to Luyang, to the Ye family.

07:24.320 --> 07:25.440
That is right!

07:26.240 --> 07:27.560
How could I forget?

07:27.640 --> 07:28.480
You still have

07:28.560 --> 07:30.480
a filthy rich maternal family
who rolls in money

07:30.560 --> 07:32.800
and is the wealthiest in their area.

07:33.360 --> 07:34.360
And His Majesty himself

07:34.440 --> 07:37.360
had just appointed Ye Shijie as
the Ministry of Revenue's Vice Director.

07:37.440 --> 07:41.000
The Ye family now has connections
in both official and business circles.

07:41.080 --> 07:42.760
If you reconcile

07:42.840 --> 07:43.920
with the Ye family,

07:44.000 --> 07:45.560
forget about Uncle Yuanbai.

07:45.640 --> 07:48.560
Even Grandmother will see you differently.

07:49.480 --> 07:51.600
Why do you suddenly want to go
to the Ye family?

07:52.160 --> 07:54.800
You just established
your reputation in the capital.

07:54.880 --> 07:56.920
Isn't it a pity to leave now?

08:05.160 --> 08:06.200
Duke Su,

08:06.280 --> 08:07.320
I am here now.

08:07.880 --> 08:10.840
What is the matter of life and death
you stated in your message?

08:10.920 --> 08:12.840
Consort Li wants
to bring you to worship Buddha.

08:15.560 --> 08:16.400
Thank you.

08:16.480 --> 08:17.680
Your play

08:18.360 --> 08:20.000
has brought more and more actors

08:20.880 --> 08:22.280
and it's becoming more interesting.

08:22.360 --> 08:24.480
To ensure this play doesn't end poorly,

08:24.560 --> 08:25.960
I want to remind you of this.

08:26.840 --> 08:29.080
Consort Li is His Majesty's
favorite consort.

08:30.160 --> 08:31.200
So I've heard.

08:31.800 --> 08:33.320
What is your next move?

08:35.000 --> 08:36.000
Avoid conflict…

08:37.280 --> 08:38.559
And do not act hastily.

08:40.240 --> 08:41.799
You think

08:41.880 --> 08:43.440
that Ye Shijie treats you well, right?

08:43.520 --> 08:46.400
Or you won't be willing
to reconcile with the Ye family now.

08:46.480 --> 08:48.560
He's a decent person

08:48.640 --> 08:50.320
and he looks quite handsome too.

08:50.400 --> 08:51.680
Compared to me,

08:51.760 --> 08:53.760
even if he falls a bit short,

08:54.480 --> 08:56.640
if he can keep protecting you,

08:56.720 --> 08:58.200
that is a good thing.

08:58.280 --> 08:59.240
Besides,

08:59.320 --> 09:00.800
if you always spend time together…

09:00.880 --> 09:03.160
It'll also make it easier for you
to approach Liu Xu.

09:07.720 --> 09:08.560
Jiang Li!

09:09.840 --> 09:11.160
What are you talking about?

09:11.240 --> 09:13.080
What nonsense is that?

09:13.160 --> 09:14.760
Both of us are best friends for life.

09:14.840 --> 09:16.640
I would never fall for her.

09:16.720 --> 09:17.760
What are you talking about?

09:17.840 --> 09:19.960
- Jiang Jingrui.
- It's impossible for me to like her.

09:20.040 --> 09:20.880
My goodness.

09:20.960 --> 09:22.400
Why are you two doing this?

09:23.760 --> 09:25.160
You are making me feel embarrassed.

09:25.240 --> 09:26.800
Why are you doing this?

09:26.880 --> 09:27.720
JIANG RESIDENCE

09:27.800 --> 09:28.680
Miss,

09:28.760 --> 09:31.320
her ladyship had a falling-out
with the Ye family before.

09:32.080 --> 09:34.080
Now, you're going alone to make amends.

09:34.880 --> 09:36.440
I worry you might be treated unfairly.

09:37.000 --> 09:39.640
That's why I must go all the more.

09:40.200 --> 09:41.720
It must also be Jiang Li's wish.

09:42.200 --> 09:44.680
I want to help her mend things
with the Ye family.

09:48.520 --> 09:49.400
Miss,

09:49.880 --> 09:52.640
you're really so nice to her ladyship.

09:54.240 --> 09:56.760
Actually, I have my own selfish reason.

09:58.200 --> 10:00.400
I remember Luyang
is not far from Huaixiang.

10:00.480 --> 10:04.080
Jiang Li is famous in the capital now.

10:05.080 --> 10:06.400
I can take a breather now.

10:07.040 --> 10:08.600
I want to go back to Huaixiang.

10:09.560 --> 10:10.520
At that time, Shen…

10:11.760 --> 10:12.880
That person

10:13.440 --> 10:14.800
said my father was convicted

10:15.600 --> 10:16.600
and executed.

10:18.400 --> 10:20.840
Perhaps no one buried him at that time.

10:21.400 --> 10:22.280
It has been so long,

10:22.360 --> 10:25.720
so I should go back and check.

10:33.560 --> 10:34.400
Quickly.

10:34.480 --> 10:36.400
Liu Xu and Ye Shijie
should have arrived long ago.

10:36.480 --> 10:37.440
- Hurry up.
- All right.

10:37.520 --> 10:38.600
Liu Xu.

10:39.120 --> 10:39.960
Liu Xu.

10:40.440 --> 10:41.680
Why did you start eating?

10:42.160 --> 10:44.000
I've long been here
and waited for a very long time.

10:44.080 --> 10:45.000
But none of you came,

10:45.080 --> 10:46.560
so I went around on my own.

10:47.920 --> 10:48.800
Where's Ye Shijie?

10:48.880 --> 10:49.720
Ye Shijie?

10:52.400 --> 10:53.560
I think

10:53.640 --> 10:55.760
- he'll be the last one to arrive.
- There's no need.

10:56.360 --> 10:57.360
I now announce

10:57.440 --> 10:59.920
that all our expenses tonight
for food, drinks, and entertainment

11:00.000 --> 11:02.720
will be paid by Ye Shijie.

11:04.080 --> 11:04.920
Agreed!

11:05.840 --> 11:06.960
When he arrives,

11:07.040 --> 11:08.760
- I'll walk around with you again.
- All right.

11:09.880 --> 11:10.720
There he is.

11:13.800 --> 11:15.160
Shiije,

11:15.240 --> 11:17.560
thanks to us getting first place
in the Annual Exam,

11:17.640 --> 11:18.920
you got an official position.

11:19.000 --> 11:19.840
That's right.

11:19.920 --> 11:20.920
Mr. Ye,

11:21.000 --> 11:22.960
you have to treat us tonight.

11:29.080 --> 11:30.280
I'm sorry.

11:30.360 --> 11:32.000
I forgot to tell you something.

11:32.080 --> 11:33.320
My second uncle
is in the capital on business

11:33.400 --> 11:34.400
and will return to Luyang in a few days.

11:34.480 --> 11:35.320
So

11:35.920 --> 11:37.880
I'm afraid I can't celebrate
the Mid-Autumn Festival with you.

11:41.760 --> 11:43.320
That's no fun.

11:43.400 --> 11:45.440
We already agreed that

11:45.520 --> 11:47.840
the last person to arrive
would cover the expenses.

11:48.480 --> 11:49.440
You're not paying

11:50.320 --> 11:51.280
and not joining us.

11:51.360 --> 11:52.360
That's right.

11:52.440 --> 11:54.280
- That's no fun.
- Yes, it's no fun.

11:54.360 --> 11:55.400
Everyone.

11:57.600 --> 11:59.440
I'm Ye Shijie's second uncle.

11:59.520 --> 12:01.440
I came at a bad time today

12:01.520 --> 12:03.240
and disturbed your fun.

12:03.320 --> 12:04.280
I'm very sorry

12:04.360 --> 12:05.720
about that.

12:05.800 --> 12:08.160
How about this?
I've reserved a table at the restaurant.

12:08.240 --> 12:10.040
If you don't mind,

12:10.120 --> 12:12.000
let's have a meal together.

12:14.080 --> 12:15.160
It's all right.

12:15.240 --> 12:17.680
It's hard to see anything
from the restaurant upstairs.

12:17.760 --> 12:19.680
Besides, we don't want to disturb you two

12:19.760 --> 12:20.640
when you are talking.

12:21.200 --> 12:22.440
All right. Let's go then.

12:28.080 --> 12:29.240
Uncle.

12:31.320 --> 12:33.080
Since you're inviting us sincerely,

12:33.160 --> 12:34.960
I also want to catch up with you.

12:37.960 --> 12:38.800
Sure.

12:41.320 --> 12:42.160
Jiang Jingrui,

12:42.240 --> 12:43.600
show Liu Xu around and have fun.

12:44.440 --> 12:45.520
Let's meet later on.

12:48.600 --> 12:50.320
Are they leaving just like that?

12:51.000 --> 12:52.640
Exactly. That's no fun at all.

12:52.720 --> 12:54.080
What a letdown. We're not friends anymore!

12:54.160 --> 12:55.320
I'm going home.

12:56.200 --> 12:57.040
What are you doing?

12:57.120 --> 12:57.960
Liu Xu,

12:58.040 --> 13:00.720
I know of a game over there
that requires two people to play.

13:00.800 --> 13:03.000
- There are prizes too.
- Who wants to play with you?

13:03.080 --> 13:05.040
Since we're already here,
let's go together.

13:05.640 --> 13:06.720
I swear.

13:06.800 --> 13:08.040
It'll be really fun.

13:08.120 --> 13:09.160
Let's go and play together.

13:10.520 --> 13:11.400
All right then.

13:11.480 --> 13:12.480
I'll play one round.

13:12.560 --> 13:13.760
If it's not fun, I'll go home.

13:13.840 --> 13:14.760
All right. Come on.

13:15.560 --> 13:17.320
Shijie mentioned you long ago.

13:17.400 --> 13:19.320
But I never expected you
to have grown up to be

13:19.400 --> 13:21.160
such an elegant lady
after all these years.

13:22.000 --> 13:23.080
When you called out to me,

13:23.160 --> 13:24.520
I was so surprised.

13:24.600 --> 13:26.000
I almost didn't recognize you.

13:26.080 --> 13:26.920
Please come this way.

13:27.000 --> 13:28.840
It has been a long time
since you've seen me.

13:28.920 --> 13:30.240
Of course you won't recognize me.

13:30.880 --> 13:33.120
That's why we need

13:33.200 --> 13:34.880
to celebrate today's reunion properly.

13:34.960 --> 13:35.800
You're right.

13:35.880 --> 13:36.760
Come and take a seat.

13:48.000 --> 13:48.840
Jiang Li,

13:50.000 --> 13:52.360
it's all thanks to you

13:52.440 --> 13:53.640
that His Majesty valued Shijie

13:53.720 --> 13:55.360
and appointed him as an official,

13:55.440 --> 13:56.440
bringing honor to our family.

13:56.520 --> 13:58.920
I heard about your good reputation

13:59.000 --> 14:01.880
as soon as I entered
the capital yesterday.

14:01.960 --> 14:05.960
Here. This drink is to thank you
and to celebrate.

14:06.040 --> 14:08.320
- Here's a toast to you.
- You're too kind, Uncle.

14:08.400 --> 14:10.000
I can't take all the credit.

14:10.080 --> 14:11.560
I should toast to you.

14:11.640 --> 14:13.160
The festive season

14:13.240 --> 14:14.400
is good for a family reunion.

14:15.160 --> 14:17.200
Why didn't you visit the Jiang Residence?

14:17.280 --> 14:18.800
I came to the capital

14:19.520 --> 14:21.080
for business matters.

14:21.160 --> 14:22.160
Shijie knows about this.

14:22.960 --> 14:24.480
So I came in a hurry

14:24.560 --> 14:26.480
and I didn't inform
the Jiang family in advance.

14:26.560 --> 14:29.000
I'm afraid of troubling them
if I visit suddenly.

14:29.080 --> 14:30.600
Since it's for business matters,

14:31.440 --> 14:34.560
wouldn't it be more convenient
with the Chief Secretariat's help?

14:37.000 --> 14:38.320
Of course.

14:40.120 --> 14:41.760
But we haven't had much contact

14:41.840 --> 14:43.760
with the Jiang family for years.

14:43.840 --> 14:45.280
And earlier, there were

14:46.600 --> 14:48.240
some misunderstandings too.

14:48.320 --> 14:49.200
So

14:49.280 --> 14:51.080
it might be too presumptuous of us.

14:51.160 --> 14:52.360
I know, Uncle.

14:53.840 --> 14:56.440
It was my fault
because I was young and ignorant.

14:56.520 --> 14:58.600
Now, I'm more mature.

15:00.240 --> 15:01.680
I felt regretful for many years.

15:01.760 --> 15:03.920
If you agree,

15:04.000 --> 15:05.640
I'll mediate for you.

15:10.080 --> 15:11.000
That would be great.

15:12.160 --> 15:13.200
Then

15:13.280 --> 15:14.320
I'll pay a visit tomorrow.

15:14.400 --> 15:15.320
Is that a good time?

15:15.400 --> 15:16.320
Of course.

15:20.880 --> 15:23.320
Since you're visiting the Jiang family,

15:23.880 --> 15:25.880
we should respond.

15:25.960 --> 15:26.880
Respond?

15:26.960 --> 15:29.560
What if I visit
the Ye family in Luyang overmorrow?

15:29.640 --> 15:31.040
This way,

15:31.120 --> 15:32.560
both families will become closer.

15:35.200 --> 15:37.000
Do you want to go to Luyang?

15:38.280 --> 15:39.120
Well,

15:39.200 --> 15:40.120
Jiang Li,

15:40.880 --> 15:43.600
you might need approval

15:43.680 --> 15:45.280
from Chancellor Jiang for that.

15:45.360 --> 15:47.480
If you mention it,

15:47.560 --> 15:49.400
I'm sure my father won't stop me.

15:52.160 --> 15:53.160
Let's eat first.

15:53.720 --> 15:54.960
The dishes are getting cold.

15:55.040 --> 15:56.680
You just want me to mediate

15:57.720 --> 15:58.920
but not see the Ye family?

15:59.000 --> 16:00.920
What nonsense is that?

16:02.120 --> 16:05.160
Of course I welcome you to the Ye family.

16:05.240 --> 16:06.560
Then please mention it

16:06.640 --> 16:07.680
to my father tomorrow

16:07.760 --> 16:09.200
when you visit the Jiang family.

16:11.560 --> 16:12.720
It's settled then.

16:16.360 --> 16:17.520
All right.

16:18.120 --> 16:19.760
Sure. Let's eat first.

16:19.840 --> 16:21.600
- Come on.
- My friends are waiting for me,

16:22.120 --> 16:22.960
so I won't be eating.

16:23.560 --> 16:24.400
Uncle.

16:24.960 --> 16:26.160
Shijie.

16:26.240 --> 16:27.240
Enjoy your meals.

16:30.720 --> 16:31.840
I'll walk Jiang Li out.

16:37.520 --> 16:38.920
Jiang Li

16:39.000 --> 16:39.960
sure is something.

16:43.440 --> 16:45.440
Have you planned
to return to Luyang early on?

16:46.000 --> 16:47.800
After all, the Ye family
is my maternal family.

16:49.080 --> 16:51.480
After all these years,
some misunderstandings must be cleared.

16:52.640 --> 16:53.640
Why so sudden?

16:53.720 --> 16:57.320
Do you still remember how we were set up

16:57.400 --> 16:58.600
- at the palace?
- Yes.

16:58.680 --> 17:01.680
My sister and cousin were involved in it.

17:01.760 --> 17:02.960
Both of them?

17:04.119 --> 17:04.960
How can that be?

17:05.040 --> 17:06.680
Now you know my situation

17:07.359 --> 17:08.319
in the Jiang family.

17:09.119 --> 17:10.280
Are you still wondering

17:10.359 --> 17:12.079
why I suddenly want to go back to Luyang?

17:12.160 --> 17:13.640
Since you see me as your cousin,

17:13.720 --> 17:14.880
I'll do my best to protect you

17:14.960 --> 17:17.160
in the capital in the future.

17:18.359 --> 17:19.200
Thank you.

17:19.280 --> 17:20.200
Let me see you off.

17:20.280 --> 17:21.560
Uncle is still waiting for you.

17:21.640 --> 17:22.640
You should go back first.

17:23.200 --> 17:24.280
I'll go by myself.

17:25.920 --> 17:26.760
All right.

18:01.160 --> 18:03.360
My lord, we got
the tickets to the theater.

18:03.440 --> 18:05.800
Tonight's play
is The World of Mortals by Little Taohong.

18:07.480 --> 18:09.320
Are you going to watch
Little Taohong tonight?

18:09.800 --> 18:11.800
Aren't you afraid they'll notice
and come after you?

18:11.880 --> 18:14.960
In my opinion,
let's just arrest this troupe first

18:15.040 --> 18:15.920
and take our time investigating.

18:16.000 --> 18:16.960
That's the safest way.

18:17.040 --> 18:17.960
It may be safe,

18:18.920 --> 18:20.280
but we will miss the show.

18:20.360 --> 18:22.320
My lord, your life will be at stake.

18:23.160 --> 18:25.360
- Do you still want to watch it?
- You'd alert the enemy.

18:26.680 --> 18:28.560
Are you telling me what to do?

18:30.760 --> 18:31.760
Lu Ji is right.

18:32.480 --> 18:35.440
We must play the long game
to catch a big fish.

18:36.120 --> 18:37.280
I not only need to watch it,

18:37.360 --> 18:39.440
but I will also find someone
to watch with me

18:40.200 --> 18:41.680
to make it convincing.

18:41.760 --> 18:42.720
Find someone?

18:42.800 --> 18:43.640
Who?

18:43.720 --> 18:44.880
Do we need to do that?

18:44.960 --> 18:46.040
I can watch it with you.

18:47.080 --> 18:47.920
What a fool.

18:48.000 --> 18:49.640
Hey, Lu Ji.

18:49.720 --> 18:51.240
Why are you so talkative today?

18:52.040 --> 18:53.160
I get it.

18:53.240 --> 18:54.520
Do you want to see the play?

18:54.600 --> 18:55.440
Fine.

18:55.520 --> 18:56.400
You can go.

18:56.480 --> 18:57.360
Find

18:59.080 --> 19:00.160
a delicate lady.

19:00.240 --> 19:01.680
You must be joking.

19:01.760 --> 19:03.640
There are only male secret guards.

19:03.720 --> 19:04.880
A lady?

19:04.960 --> 19:06.040
Do you mean Jiuyue?

19:07.600 --> 19:09.960
We might as well pick anyone
from the street.

19:10.680 --> 19:12.440
Then pick anyone from the street.

19:23.360 --> 19:24.280
Ms. Jiang,

19:24.360 --> 19:26.400
his lordship wants to invite you
to the theater for a chat.

19:31.640 --> 19:32.760
If you refuse…

19:37.000 --> 19:37.920
Come on.

19:54.200 --> 19:58.080
WATCHING THE SEA AND SKY

20:01.680 --> 20:02.720
Where is Wen Ji?

20:02.800 --> 20:04.480
Duke Su, why do you want to see me?

20:04.560 --> 20:06.440
Can you change your opening line?

20:06.520 --> 20:08.480
- Duke Su, do you have nothing to do again?
- Yes.

20:08.960 --> 20:10.360
So I'm inviting you to watch a play.

20:14.400 --> 20:16.520
Can I repay a favor that way?

20:16.600 --> 20:19.560
Watching a play to repay a favor?

20:19.640 --> 20:21.400
You're quite calculating.

20:21.480 --> 20:23.000
If you don't agree,

20:24.040 --> 20:25.120
I'll leave.

20:25.600 --> 20:26.840
Fine.

20:30.000 --> 20:30.840
Two favors left.

20:32.240 --> 20:33.760
You sure know how to do the math.

20:33.840 --> 20:35.160
I don't want you to suffer losses.

20:35.640 --> 20:37.080
I'm always calculating.

20:39.760 --> 20:41.760
Choose any of the three teas.

20:53.240 --> 20:54.680
Too bad I don't know tea.

20:55.280 --> 20:56.400
I can only pick one randomly.

20:57.480 --> 20:59.080
I'm sorry for letting down your kindness.

20:59.560 --> 21:00.880
It's nothing complex.

21:01.640 --> 21:05.000
It may taste bitter, astringent,
fresh, or sweet.

21:06.240 --> 21:09.280
Different people like different teas.

21:20.600 --> 21:22.360
I chose the bitter one.

21:22.440 --> 21:23.600
You clearly picked

21:23.680 --> 21:24.920
the sweetest aged tea.

21:25.520 --> 21:26.760
But you said it tastes bitter.

21:27.640 --> 21:30.680
It shows there's something bitter

21:31.640 --> 21:33.080
in your heart.

21:34.440 --> 21:35.720
Duke Su, you must be joking.

21:36.720 --> 21:39.480
Maybe my taste buds
are different from others.

21:39.560 --> 21:41.360
What's bitter to others

21:41.880 --> 21:43.360
might be sweet to me.

21:43.440 --> 21:45.240
What do you

21:46.640 --> 21:48.200
consider bitter then?

21:49.920 --> 21:52.080
The fate of humans,

21:52.160 --> 21:54.920
love, hate, affection, feud.

21:56.360 --> 21:59.280
There are many bitter things
in this world.

21:59.360 --> 22:00.760
Is love and affection

22:01.600 --> 22:04.440
bitter to you?

22:07.800 --> 22:08.640
Duke Su,

22:09.880 --> 22:11.280
did you invite me to watch a play

22:12.360 --> 22:15.040
just to talk about love and affection?

22:15.120 --> 22:16.920
- Can't I?
- No, you can't.

22:17.880 --> 22:18.840
Let's watch the play.

22:24.000 --> 22:28.760
WATCHING THE SEA AND SKY

23:16.240 --> 23:18.960
- Marvelous!
- Nice!

23:19.040 --> 23:19.920
Impressive skills!

23:20.000 --> 23:21.520
Great moves and agility!

23:22.880 --> 23:24.840
Li, you sure know
how to appreciate a play.

23:24.920 --> 23:28.360
- With long sleeves fluttering
- I can see you're engrossed in watching.

23:28.440 --> 23:31.240
- Everyone danced and sang together
- This play is really good.

23:31.320 --> 23:32.760
The best part is yet to come.

23:32.840 --> 23:39.480
The singing echoed for a long time

23:40.040 --> 23:46.640
The wind blows on the branches,
Causing shadows to sway

23:46.720 --> 23:49.640
The gentle breeze carries

23:49.720 --> 23:56.400
The fragrance of flowers far away

23:56.480 --> 23:59.720
- Great!
- Marvelous!

23:59.800 --> 24:00.800
I'll give you a reward.

24:01.280 --> 24:03.000
Thank you, Duke Su.

24:03.080 --> 24:05.120
I'm truly grateful.

24:14.240 --> 24:15.600
Duke Su,

24:15.680 --> 24:17.960
what do you think about today's play?

24:22.080 --> 24:23.200
You should not ask me…

24:24.760 --> 24:26.840
but this lady beside me.

24:30.760 --> 24:32.120
It's vigorous and rhythmic.

24:32.600 --> 24:34.360
It's deeply satisfying and exhilarating.

24:34.440 --> 24:36.040
You are knowledgeable about plays.

24:36.120 --> 24:38.680
No wonder you are Duke Su's
esteemed guest.

24:39.280 --> 24:41.160
Not only does this lady know about plays,

24:43.280 --> 24:44.840
she also knows how to perform.

25:34.080 --> 25:35.200
Leave her alive.

25:35.680 --> 25:37.480
Be sure to find out the mastermind.

25:38.360 --> 25:39.200
Take her away.

25:39.280 --> 25:40.160
- Yes.
- Yes.

26:25.120 --> 26:26.320
Thank you, Duke Su.

26:26.400 --> 26:28.120
You offered to dress up my wound,

26:29.440 --> 26:30.920
so I don't owe you a favor.

26:31.600 --> 26:32.840
If you consider this a favor,

26:32.920 --> 26:34.240
I'll get someone else to dress it.

26:48.240 --> 26:50.120
Are you that afraid of owing me favors?

26:50.200 --> 26:51.800
Favors are also debts.

26:52.440 --> 26:53.760
They need to be repaid in the end.

26:53.840 --> 26:57.200
People already carry
heavy burdens in life.

26:57.280 --> 26:59.320
Having too much debt is a hindrance.

26:59.800 --> 27:03.320
But you wished me a bright future
during the guqin test.

27:03.880 --> 27:05.160
Have you forgotten about that?

27:06.760 --> 27:07.880
Are you blaming me now?

27:08.480 --> 27:10.440
The moment you invited me to this theater,

27:12.560 --> 27:14.920
I appeared to be your esteemed guest.

27:15.520 --> 27:17.240
But in reality, I'm just your cover

27:19.400 --> 27:21.680
to let your people hide in ambush

27:23.160 --> 27:24.800
and lower the troupe's guard.

27:26.920 --> 27:27.880
As for saying

27:28.640 --> 27:29.680
that I blame you…

27:30.760 --> 27:31.640
Not really.

27:33.160 --> 27:35.960
I'm grateful

27:36.720 --> 27:38.200
to be useful to you, Duke Su.

28:10.560 --> 28:12.560
Ill-gotten wealth from the capital

28:12.640 --> 28:13.920
is gathered into the troupe.

28:15.280 --> 28:17.320
Using your performances as a cover,

28:17.400 --> 28:18.680
they're transported to the north

28:20.920 --> 28:23.560
to provide money for Prince Cheng
to recruit soldiers and buy horses.

28:26.920 --> 28:28.480
That was your deal.

28:28.960 --> 28:29.800
Am I right?

28:32.960 --> 28:35.560
I'm not in the mood today
to argue with you.

28:35.640 --> 28:38.840
Treason is punishable by death.

28:39.400 --> 28:41.360
I'll pay three times the amount
Prince Cheng pays you

28:41.440 --> 28:42.440
to risk your life for him.

28:47.000 --> 28:49.520
Do you really think a performer like you

28:50.000 --> 28:52.320
can become the Princess Consort?

29:00.480 --> 29:01.440
I'm annoyed.

29:01.520 --> 29:04.040
Lu Ji, carve the "play" word on her face,

29:04.120 --> 29:06.800
make her a mute, cut off the tendons
in her limbs, and throw her out.

29:07.480 --> 29:08.800
If Prince Cheng still wants you,

29:09.840 --> 29:11.640
I'll give you three taels
for travel expenses.

29:11.720 --> 29:13.200
What's wrong with his lordship today?

29:13.280 --> 29:15.240
He usually enjoys interrogating them.

29:15.320 --> 29:16.360
What are you waiting for?

29:17.440 --> 29:18.400
Don't do it.

29:24.920 --> 29:26.920
Fine. I'll tell you.

29:30.920 --> 29:32.120
Didn't you arrest them?

29:32.600 --> 29:34.200
Why do I feel like you're in a bad mood?

29:40.560 --> 29:42.240
Are you keeping things from me too?

29:48.720 --> 29:50.720
Fine. Forget it
if you don't want to tell me.

29:50.800 --> 29:52.400
They tried to kill you,

29:52.480 --> 29:54.160
so it seems you've gotten in their way.

29:54.240 --> 29:55.440
The north isn't prosperous.

29:55.520 --> 29:57.360
Prince Cheng has been
recruiting soldiers for years,

29:57.440 --> 29:58.400
draining his resources.

29:58.480 --> 30:00.520
Cutting off his source of income
in the Central Plains

30:00.600 --> 30:02.400
is like choking him.

30:02.480 --> 30:03.640
They could have come at me

30:04.360 --> 30:05.640
much earlier.

30:05.720 --> 30:07.560
What's your plan now?

30:07.640 --> 30:08.560
I have a feeling

30:09.120 --> 30:11.320
that salt trafficking
is just one way to make money.

30:11.400 --> 30:12.880
There must be a more significant one.

30:16.240 --> 30:17.480
How did it go with the assassin?

30:17.560 --> 30:18.720
She gave me some intel.

30:19.360 --> 30:21.160
She said Prince Cheng

30:21.680 --> 30:23.920
has a secret training ground
for assassins in Luyang.

30:24.000 --> 30:25.240
She's just one of them.

30:25.760 --> 30:27.080
If we don't destroy it,

30:27.160 --> 30:28.640
your trusted ministers

30:28.720 --> 30:30.080
might be assassinated one by one

30:30.160 --> 30:32.160
before Prince Cheng makes a move.

30:32.240 --> 30:34.080
So are you going to Luyang personally?

30:34.880 --> 30:35.880
Yes.

30:37.520 --> 30:38.520
Chancellor Jiang,

30:38.600 --> 30:40.800
I'm here to express my gratitude
for being appointed.

30:40.880 --> 30:43.520
That was His Majesty's grace.
It has nothing to do with me.

30:43.600 --> 30:44.960
Why express gratitude?

30:45.040 --> 30:46.960
I'm afraid you didn't come here

30:47.040 --> 30:49.080
without a reason.

30:49.160 --> 30:51.160
I can't hide anything from you.

30:51.240 --> 30:53.040
This is my second uncle, Ye Mingxuan.

30:53.760 --> 30:56.680
He came from Luyang
and brought some small gifts.

30:56.760 --> 30:58.160
I hope you will like it.

30:58.680 --> 30:59.520
Chancellor Jiang,

30:59.600 --> 31:00.960
it has been a long time.

31:01.040 --> 31:02.400
Mingxuan.

31:03.880 --> 31:05.680
Why didn't you inform me in advance

31:05.760 --> 31:07.480
of your visit?

31:11.440 --> 31:12.320
Well…

31:13.120 --> 31:14.080
Father.

31:20.160 --> 31:21.000
Father,

31:21.480 --> 31:23.160
we met at the Lantern Festival

31:23.720 --> 31:25.280
and had a good conversation.

31:25.360 --> 31:26.760
I couldn't stay out too late,

31:26.840 --> 31:28.720
so I invited Shijie

31:28.800 --> 31:30.880
and Uncle Mingxuan to visit.

31:33.720 --> 31:34.600
Please take a seat.

31:43.560 --> 31:46.920
It has been a while
since you've been in the capital, right?

31:47.000 --> 31:47.840
Yes.

31:47.920 --> 31:48.800
I came this time

31:48.880 --> 31:51.040
to handle some business matters

31:51.120 --> 31:53.120
and to visit my nephew.

31:53.200 --> 31:54.760
After all, he has been away for so long,

31:54.840 --> 31:56.280
so the family can't help but worry.

31:56.360 --> 31:58.600
You'll be working
in the imperial court together,

31:58.680 --> 32:01.760
so I have to rely on you
to look after him.

32:01.840 --> 32:02.960
That's too kind.

32:03.040 --> 32:04.840
Ye Shijie is talented.

32:04.920 --> 32:07.080
Even without my guidance, he can achieve

32:07.160 --> 32:08.360
great success on his own.

32:09.920 --> 32:13.360
How is Old Madam Ye's health?

32:13.440 --> 32:14.880
She's all right.

32:14.960 --> 32:15.920
But her energy

32:16.000 --> 32:17.360
is declining year by year.

32:17.920 --> 32:20.680
As she gets older,
she misses her family more.

32:22.080 --> 32:23.280
So this time,

32:23.360 --> 32:25.160
I have a presumptuous request.

32:27.080 --> 32:29.440
Jiang Li has never been to Luyang

32:29.520 --> 32:30.960
since birth.

32:31.040 --> 32:33.880
I wonder if you would allow me

32:33.960 --> 32:35.400
to take Jiang Li back

32:35.480 --> 32:36.920
to visit Old Madam.

32:45.400 --> 32:46.760
A trip to Luyang?

32:47.360 --> 32:48.200
Yes.

32:48.280 --> 32:50.680
Jiang Li didn't want to
when she was a child.

32:50.760 --> 32:52.160
But now, she's all grown up.

32:52.240 --> 32:53.440
I've asked for her opinion.

32:53.960 --> 32:55.320
She also wants to go back to visit.

32:58.600 --> 33:01.400
Luyang is far away

33:01.480 --> 33:03.360
and Li'er has just returned.

33:04.000 --> 33:05.600
It's not suitable to go south now.

33:05.680 --> 33:06.760
Don't you think?

33:08.720 --> 33:09.800
Father,

33:09.880 --> 33:11.520
I've never been to Luyang.

33:11.600 --> 33:12.960
If you permit

33:13.480 --> 33:15.160
and if Uncle Mingxuan
is willing to take me,

33:16.000 --> 33:18.880
while nothing is going on at school

33:18.960 --> 33:20.240
since the Annual Exam is done,

33:20.720 --> 33:21.960
I'd like to visit Luyang.

33:22.040 --> 33:24.440
It's a long journey

33:24.520 --> 33:26.440
and you've never been to Luyang.

33:27.200 --> 33:28.560
You may not get used to it there.

33:28.640 --> 33:30.120
Father, you're worrying too much.

33:31.760 --> 33:34.800
If I can get used to staying
at Zhennv Hall

33:34.880 --> 33:36.040
in Qingcheng Mountain,

33:36.880 --> 33:40.000
Luyang is much livelier than Zhennv Hall.

33:40.080 --> 33:41.920
Your mother said

33:42.480 --> 33:44.560
Consort Li wants to take you
to worship Buddha

33:44.640 --> 33:46.480
in the next few days.

33:46.560 --> 33:48.600
The imperial decree may arrive soon.

33:48.680 --> 33:49.920
During this time,

33:50.600 --> 33:52.840
it's better for you
to stay in the capital.

33:57.680 --> 34:00.080
Since Li'er wants to go to Luyang,

34:00.560 --> 34:02.080
you should just let her go.

34:02.160 --> 34:03.000
Mother.

34:03.080 --> 34:04.880
As for Consort Li,

34:04.960 --> 34:06.440
she can go after she comes back.

34:07.040 --> 34:08.560
Let's have Shuran talk to her.

34:08.639 --> 34:10.639
Consort Li is kind and compassionate.

34:10.719 --> 34:11.760
She will surely understand.

34:12.719 --> 34:14.440
Because of the Annual Exam,

34:14.520 --> 34:17.080
Li'er suffered a lot.

34:17.159 --> 34:19.639
Let her go out and relax.

34:20.360 --> 34:21.400
Besides,

34:21.480 --> 34:22.960
Old Madam Ye

34:23.040 --> 34:24.880
used to dote on Li'er.

34:25.600 --> 34:27.199
Now that she's all grown up,

34:27.760 --> 34:29.199
she should pay her a visit.

34:34.760 --> 34:37.719
Actually, Li'er discussed this
with me earlier.

34:37.800 --> 34:39.000
Do you really not know

34:39.760 --> 34:42.199
Consort Li's true intention

34:42.280 --> 34:43.960
of having Li'er worship with her?

34:45.560 --> 34:47.280
What's done is done.

34:48.239 --> 34:50.320
Even if Li'er really made a mistake,

34:51.239 --> 34:53.360
can you say Ruoyao and Yu'e

34:53.840 --> 34:55.239
were completely innocent?

34:55.320 --> 34:57.640
As the head of the family,

34:57.720 --> 34:59.920
you can't be so biased.

35:00.000 --> 35:02.640
Li'er just came back from Zhennv Hall

35:03.320 --> 35:05.040
and you want her to suffer
in the mountains again.

35:05.120 --> 35:09.120
It's good that Shuran interacts
with Consort Li.

35:09.200 --> 35:10.640
But it's your job

35:11.360 --> 35:12.720
as her husband

35:14.160 --> 35:18.520
to help her decide what to say
and what not to say.

35:19.280 --> 35:20.640
Shuran

35:21.240 --> 35:22.400
is selfish.

35:22.480 --> 35:24.280
She might say something inappropriate

35:24.360 --> 35:26.160
that reaches His Majesty's ears.

35:26.240 --> 35:28.080
You, as the Chancellor,

35:29.160 --> 35:31.440
being constantly asked
about family matters

35:31.520 --> 35:33.240
isn't good.

35:33.320 --> 35:34.800
Think about it.

35:38.720 --> 35:40.400
That girl must be going to Luyang

35:41.160 --> 35:42.640
to avoid worshiping Buddha

35:43.480 --> 35:45.280
and to find support there.

35:46.240 --> 35:47.680
It's obvious

35:47.760 --> 35:50.080
that she knows
she has no standing in the Jiang family.

35:51.880 --> 35:54.720
You should use this chance
to please your father

35:54.800 --> 35:57.320
and improve your reputation

35:57.400 --> 35:58.760
among noble ladies.

35:59.240 --> 36:00.640
When she comes back,

36:00.720 --> 36:03.480
make sure she has no place in the capital.

36:04.160 --> 36:05.360
Are you listening to me?

36:05.440 --> 36:07.360
Is my engagement

36:08.200 --> 36:09.520
with Zhou Yanbang really canceled?

36:09.600 --> 36:12.240
- There will be better matches.
- However,

36:12.880 --> 36:14.520
I truly like him.

36:15.400 --> 36:16.240
Yao'er,

36:17.080 --> 36:18.800
you are still young.

36:18.880 --> 36:20.760
When you grow up, you'll realize

36:20.840 --> 36:22.280
that affection and love are

36:22.360 --> 36:23.920
the least valuable things in the world.

36:25.200 --> 36:27.320
I only want Mr. Zhou.

36:27.400 --> 36:29.720
I have found another suitable man for you,

36:30.240 --> 36:31.480
so don't mention him again.

36:37.600 --> 36:41.200
IMPROVE VIRTUE
AND EXPAND ACHIEVEMENTS

36:45.200 --> 36:46.040
Shijie.

36:48.160 --> 36:49.000
- Jiang Li!
- Jiang Li!

36:52.200 --> 36:53.120
Take this.

36:53.200 --> 36:54.600
These are your favorite snacks.

36:55.160 --> 36:57.120
This can cool you down from the heat.

36:57.200 --> 36:58.840
- It doesn't spoil easily.
- Tong'er.

36:59.320 --> 37:00.200
Have more of it.

37:00.280 --> 37:01.120
Here's mine.

37:01.200 --> 37:03.600
These are my favorites,

37:03.680 --> 37:06.040
these are my mother's favorites,

37:06.120 --> 37:07.840
and these are my father's favorites.

37:07.920 --> 37:08.760
You can eat them all.

37:11.080 --> 37:13.440
Be careful on your journey.

37:14.000 --> 37:14.840
Tong'er.

37:16.880 --> 37:18.360
You gave me so many delicious foods,

37:18.440 --> 37:20.000
which are all your favorites

37:20.560 --> 37:21.760
and your parents' favorites.

37:23.240 --> 37:25.400
Are you trying to make me gain weight?
Tong'er.

37:26.880 --> 37:27.920
It's a long journey.

37:28.000 --> 37:30.960
Who knows what you might lack
along the way?

37:31.040 --> 37:32.040
She won't lack anything.

37:32.120 --> 37:34.440
The Ye family is a big merchant family.
They lack nothing.

37:35.040 --> 37:36.520
- I've already talked to Uncle Mingxuan.
- I'm fine.

37:36.600 --> 37:37.920
He'll take good care of her.

37:38.400 --> 37:39.240
Li'er!

37:40.800 --> 37:41.840
It's time.

37:42.360 --> 37:43.200
We should leave.

37:43.280 --> 37:46.760
JIANG RESIDENCE

37:46.840 --> 37:47.760
Already?

37:50.160 --> 37:51.000
I'm leaving now.

37:52.680 --> 37:53.960
Jiang Li,

37:55.360 --> 37:57.080
we've just met

37:57.160 --> 38:00.200
and now you're leaving
before we even have a meal together.

38:01.560 --> 38:03.680
I am to blame during the Lantern Festival.

38:04.360 --> 38:05.480
When Jiang Li comes back,

38:05.560 --> 38:07.960
I'll make up for that meal, all right?

38:10.080 --> 38:11.760
You're really thoughtful, Shijie.

38:11.840 --> 38:12.760
You even remember that.

38:18.960 --> 38:20.160
Who wants you to make it up?

38:20.720 --> 38:22.440
I want Jiang Li to host it.

38:22.520 --> 38:24.840
Because you owe me.

38:24.920 --> 38:25.760
All right.

38:25.840 --> 38:28.160
I'll be back soon to host it.

39:10.960 --> 39:12.000
When I come back here,

39:12.720 --> 39:15.760
I'll make them pay.

39:22.600 --> 39:23.760
My lord.

39:23.840 --> 39:25.680
Based on the information
from Little Taohong,

39:26.160 --> 39:27.960
we found out
that the one in charge in Luyang

39:28.040 --> 39:29.600
is Prince Cheng's trusted aide, Chu Lan.

39:30.080 --> 39:31.840
However, Chu Lan isn't always in Luyang

39:31.920 --> 39:33.080
and is elusive.

39:33.160 --> 39:35.280
I've asked all our informants in Luyang

39:35.360 --> 39:36.960
and found out he had a lover.

39:37.040 --> 39:38.880
Wu Lan, the top courtesan
at Xihua Brothel.

39:41.800 --> 39:42.800
What about the Li family?

39:43.280 --> 39:46.120
They bypassed Ye Shijie and directly
made a move against the Ye family.

39:47.080 --> 39:48.440
How did the Ye family react?

39:48.520 --> 39:51.000
They're slow,
unaware that they're already trapped.

39:51.080 --> 39:53.240
If the Ye family
can be so easily controlled,

39:54.320 --> 39:58.680
it just shows
they've had it too easy before.

40:00.440 --> 40:02.360
When do we take action then?

40:04.280 --> 40:08.360
It seems like we need to go to Luyang too.

40:09.440 --> 40:11.200
My lord, that's quite a coincidence.

40:11.280 --> 40:13.040
I heard Ms. Jiang Li

40:13.120 --> 40:14.440
is also heading to Luyang today,

40:14.520 --> 40:16.600
saying she's visiting her maternal family.

40:19.840 --> 40:20.960
Get 15 canes as punishment.

40:21.040 --> 40:22.200
What's it for this time?

40:22.280 --> 40:24.240
Wasting informants
in seeking useless information.

40:24.320 --> 40:26.200
My lord, you told me before to keep an eye

40:26.280 --> 40:27.760
- on Ms. Jiang Li.
- Another five canes

40:27.840 --> 40:28.680
for talking back.

40:57.200 --> 40:58.720
CAPITAL

41:00.440 --> 41:01.560
LUYANG

41:05.720 --> 41:06.760
- Fu.
- Master.

41:07.640 --> 41:08.640
Go to the residence first

41:08.720 --> 41:10.480
and inform Old Madam and Madam

41:10.560 --> 41:11.440
that…

41:16.120 --> 41:17.800
Forget it. We'll just do as we see fit.

41:17.880 --> 41:19.560
- Just tell them I'm back.
- Yes, Master.

41:25.280 --> 41:31.040
YE RESIDENCE

41:34.440 --> 41:36.000
Dear, I'm home!

41:36.720 --> 41:37.600
Dear.

41:37.680 --> 41:38.760
Jiang Li, come in.

41:38.840 --> 41:39.720
Dear.

41:40.240 --> 41:41.080
Dear!

41:41.160 --> 41:42.000
I'm home!

41:44.760 --> 41:45.600
Dear!

41:47.760 --> 41:48.840
Dear!

41:50.960 --> 41:52.560
What's going on? Where's everyone?

41:52.640 --> 41:55.280
Master, someone went to the shop
to return Soochow brocade again,

41:55.360 --> 41:57.160
so Madam went to handle it.

42:03.360 --> 42:04.200
Jiang Li,

42:04.760 --> 42:07.000
your second aunt went to the shop
to handle some matters.

42:07.080 --> 42:08.920
I'll introduce you to them later.

42:09.000 --> 42:09.840
All right.

42:10.320 --> 42:11.160
Let's go.

42:18.520 --> 42:19.480
Here we are.

42:19.560 --> 42:20.680
It was a long journey.

42:20.760 --> 42:21.600
Jiang Li,

42:21.680 --> 42:22.720
get some rest inside first.

42:22.800 --> 42:25.560
I need to take care of other matters.

42:25.640 --> 42:28.800
It might take quite a long time.

42:29.280 --> 42:30.120
Uncle Mingxuan,

42:30.600 --> 42:31.720
we'll leave you to your work.

42:31.800 --> 42:33.920
- We can take care of ourselves.
- All right.

42:34.000 --> 42:35.240
When your aunt returns,

42:35.320 --> 42:37.040
I'll ask her to entertain you.

42:37.120 --> 42:39.240
You don't know how nice your aunt is.

42:45.080 --> 42:45.960
Miss,

42:46.040 --> 42:47.920
why isn't there a single person here?

42:48.000 --> 42:49.800
Are they trying to put you in your place?

42:50.360 --> 42:52.840
Could the Ye family be
in some kind of trouble?

43:00.520 --> 43:01.360
MADAM ZHUO

43:01.440 --> 43:02.560
The weather is getting cold.

43:02.640 --> 43:03.880
Did you prepare Mingxuan's hand warmer?

43:04.480 --> 43:05.840
Remember to use the red copper one.

43:05.920 --> 43:07.240
Don't burn Mingxuan's hands.

43:07.320 --> 43:08.480
Yes, Madam Zhuo.

43:09.440 --> 43:10.840
Tell the servants
to prepare some red dates.

43:10.920 --> 43:13.480
When Mingxuan returns, I'll personally
make chicken soup to nourish him.

43:13.560 --> 43:15.560
Grind the dragon and phoenix round tea
in my room

43:15.640 --> 43:16.640
and sieve them finely.

43:16.720 --> 43:17.760
I'll drink some good tea

43:17.840 --> 43:19.000
with Mingxuan when he returns.

43:19.480 --> 43:20.320
Yes, Madam Zhuo.

43:22.680 --> 43:24.200
Madam Zhuo, do you know that

43:24.280 --> 43:26.040
something huge happened
to the Zhang family?

43:26.120 --> 43:27.800
Really? What happened?

43:27.880 --> 43:29.440
Mrs. Zhang is being

43:29.520 --> 43:31.080
all dramatic at home.

43:31.880 --> 43:32.880
She finally has it coming.

43:33.920 --> 43:34.800
Do you know why?

43:34.880 --> 43:36.160
It was because a little vixen

43:36.240 --> 43:38.960
came to Zhang Residence yesterday.

43:39.840 --> 43:41.080
Now, this is going to be fun.

43:43.440 --> 43:44.880
What does the little vixen look like?

43:44.960 --> 43:46.760
- Well, she looks just like--
- Madam Zhuo!

43:48.440 --> 43:50.280
A little vixen came to our house.

43:50.360 --> 43:51.400
What?

43:54.480 --> 43:56.160
Something big is going to happen.

43:56.240 --> 43:57.080
XINZHU CHAMBER

43:57.160 --> 43:58.560
Ye Mingxuan!

43:58.640 --> 44:00.360
Ye Mingxuan, you unfaithful man! Come out!

44:01.120 --> 44:01.960
Where is Mingxuan?

44:02.480 --> 44:03.440
He just went out.

44:04.080 --> 44:05.120
You little vixen,

44:05.200 --> 44:06.680
how dare you come to the Ye Residence!

44:06.760 --> 44:07.640
Watch how I deal with you!

44:07.720 --> 44:08.800
- Madam Zhuo.
- Come out!

44:08.880 --> 44:09.760
Madam Zhuo!

44:10.600 --> 44:12.120
Madam Zhuo, you can't do this.

44:12.200 --> 44:13.800
Your status is noble.

44:13.880 --> 44:16.440
How can you personally go
and confront that little vixen?

44:16.520 --> 44:19.040
You might fall for her trap
if you're not careful.

44:19.120 --> 44:19.960
What trap?

44:20.520 --> 44:22.120
When a person is fuming with rage,

44:22.200 --> 44:23.920
it's easy to act impulsively.

44:24.000 --> 44:26.480
No matter how you beat or scold her,

44:26.560 --> 44:28.120
won't it give the vixen a chance

44:28.200 --> 44:31.080
to make up stories in front of Mr. Ye?

44:31.560 --> 44:33.920
Madam Zhuo, don't dirty your hands.

44:34.000 --> 44:35.840
Let me go and check things out first.

44:35.920 --> 44:36.880
You're right.

44:37.440 --> 44:38.560
I'll wait for you in my room.

44:38.640 --> 44:39.680
You go.

44:39.760 --> 44:41.520
I'll tear her apart today.

44:41.600 --> 44:42.440
Just watch me.

44:44.280 --> 44:45.360
Open the door!

44:45.440 --> 44:46.360
Open this door now!

44:46.840 --> 44:47.680
Who is it?

44:47.760 --> 44:49.440
- Open the door now!
- Coming.

44:50.160 --> 44:51.840
Open the door. Do you hear me?

44:54.680 --> 44:56.720
You must be the little vixen's sister.

44:56.800 --> 44:57.680
Who are you?

44:58.440 --> 45:00.120
Tell your mistress to show herself.

45:01.240 --> 45:02.440
I'm asking who you are.

45:02.520 --> 45:03.880
Who are you to ask who I am?

45:03.960 --> 45:05.360
Tell your mistress to come out now!

45:05.440 --> 45:06.800
Don't taint the Ye Residence!

45:06.880 --> 45:08.160
How can you be so rude?

45:08.240 --> 45:09.240
Mr. Ye

45:09.320 --> 45:11.120
told us to stay here.

45:11.200 --> 45:12.520
- You vixen!
- Don't come in!

45:12.600 --> 45:13.800
- Come out!
- Get out!

45:15.320 --> 45:17.080
You rude servant, if you want us to leave,

45:17.160 --> 45:18.360
tell Mr. Ye to do it.

45:18.440 --> 45:20.400
You bunch of vixens,

45:20.480 --> 45:22.960
you want to do it the hard way.

45:23.040 --> 45:23.880
Fine. Just wait!

45:30.880 --> 45:31.720
Tong'er.

45:34.600 --> 45:35.880
Who was that just now?

45:35.960 --> 45:37.360
Why were you arguing?

45:37.440 --> 45:39.680
Miss, we can't stay at the Ye Residence.

45:39.760 --> 45:41.120
An aggressive maid just came

45:41.200 --> 45:42.120
and told us to leave.

45:42.200 --> 45:43.920
She even said you were a little vixen

45:44.000 --> 45:45.840
and I'm the little vixen's younger sister.

45:45.920 --> 45:48.160
I think the Ye family
is trying to humiliate you.

45:51.040 --> 45:51.960
Since that is the case,

45:52.520 --> 45:53.480
we can go out first.

45:53.560 --> 45:54.920
Let's see when Uncle Mingxuan returns.

45:56.920 --> 45:58.240
How cocky.

45:59.120 --> 46:01.440
That little vixen is taking advantage
of Mingxuan's favor

46:01.520 --> 46:03.760
and has no respect for me
as the madam of the family.

46:03.840 --> 46:07.200
That's right.
This little vixen is so outrageous.

46:07.280 --> 46:08.120
Madam Zhuo,

46:08.200 --> 46:09.400
it's time for you to step in

46:09.480 --> 46:11.160
and take care of this little vixen.

46:11.240 --> 46:12.680
Since this little vixen is fearless,

46:12.760 --> 46:14.680
see how I'll deal with her.

46:35.000 --> 46:36.880
Madam Zhuo, could this little vixen

46:37.360 --> 46:39.040
have sensed trouble

46:39.640 --> 46:40.720
and gone to complain to Mr. Ye?

46:40.800 --> 46:42.280
That little vixen.

46:42.840 --> 46:44.120
Ye Mingxuan,

46:44.200 --> 46:45.320
I won't let you off the hook.

46:50.240 --> 46:52.200
Miss, where are we going?

46:55.000 --> 46:56.680
Accompany me to visit an old friend.

46:56.760 --> 46:57.800
An old friend?

46:58.640 --> 46:59.480
Wait.

47:00.240 --> 47:01.480
Are you here to see Qiong Zhi?

47:05.640 --> 47:07.400
Qiong Zhi is not home now.

47:07.480 --> 47:08.880
Where is she now?

47:08.960 --> 47:10.120
If you're in a rush,

47:10.200 --> 47:11.480
go and find her at Xihua Brothel.

47:14.720 --> 47:15.840
Xihua Brothel?

47:16.480 --> 47:19.040
That's the most famous brothel in Luyang.

47:20.760 --> 47:21.960
XIHUA BROTHEL

47:22.040 --> 47:23.680
Come again.

47:27.560 --> 47:29.480
Please come inside.

47:34.480 --> 47:35.480
My lord,

47:35.560 --> 47:37.280
Wu Lan is very alert.

47:37.360 --> 47:38.640
If we deploy controls in advance,

47:38.720 --> 47:40.320
I'm afraid she'll notice something.

47:40.880 --> 47:42.520
If we alert her,

47:42.600 --> 47:44.920
- Chu Lan won't show up.
- So?

47:45.000 --> 47:46.640
We should disguise ourselves as customers,

47:49.200 --> 47:50.680
get close to her, control her,

47:50.760 --> 47:52.800
and use her to lure out Chu Lan.

47:54.480 --> 47:55.640
What are you waiting for then?

47:55.720 --> 47:56.640
Begin.

47:56.720 --> 47:57.560
My lord,

47:58.440 --> 48:01.920
who among us do you think
looks more like a brothel customer?

48:12.640 --> 48:13.600
Sir,

48:13.680 --> 48:14.800
why didn't you only come now?

48:14.880 --> 48:15.880
Did you get Wu Lan for me?

48:16.840 --> 48:18.680
All right. Be patient.

48:18.760 --> 48:20.400
Wu Lan will be here soon.

48:20.480 --> 48:22.880
Come on. Sit here for a while.

48:22.960 --> 48:23.880
Madam,

48:24.640 --> 48:25.840
a lady is here.

48:31.280 --> 48:32.200
Miss,

48:32.280 --> 48:34.040
this isn't the place for you.

48:34.640 --> 48:36.400
I'd like to see Ms. Qiong Zhi.

48:36.480 --> 48:38.280
Our top courtesan

48:38.360 --> 48:40.040
doesn't entertain female guests.

48:40.120 --> 48:41.080
Top courtesan?

48:44.920 --> 48:46.880
I'm not someone's wife
who's here to cause trouble.

48:47.640 --> 48:50.000
I'm here to inquire about something
with Ms. Qiong Zhi.

48:52.280 --> 48:53.320
Please grant me this favor.

49:06.680 --> 49:07.520
Miss,

49:07.600 --> 49:09.160
this is Ms. Qiong Zhi's room.

49:21.280 --> 49:22.640
Who are you?

49:22.720 --> 49:24.920
What else could a man come here be for?

49:25.000 --> 49:27.680
WU LAN

49:27.760 --> 49:31.400
You have a striking appearance.

49:31.480 --> 49:32.640
Dressed in red,

49:32.720 --> 49:36.440
you look even more charming than Wu Lan.

49:36.520 --> 49:37.960
Since Wu Lan isn't here yet,

49:38.040 --> 49:41.800
why not join me for tea?

50:33.120 --> 50:34.320
How did you see through me?

50:34.400 --> 50:35.800
I've been investigating cases for years.

50:35.880 --> 50:37.680
No disguise can escape me.

50:55.200 --> 50:56.400
Ms. Qiong Zhi.

50:58.200 --> 51:01.120
QIONG ZHI

51:01.200 --> 51:02.760
Miss, you must be in the wrong room.

51:05.880 --> 51:08.040
Would you like to listen to music
or have a drink?

51:16.320 --> 51:18.760
This happens when some guests
are having too much fun.

51:20.680 --> 51:21.520
Duke Su,

51:22.160 --> 51:25.000
do you really believe
Little Taohong would give you information?

51:28.280 --> 51:29.880
Since you know Little Taohong,

51:29.960 --> 51:31.320
my trip here isn't a waste.

51:38.320 --> 51:41.240
I came to ask you something,
Ms. Qiong Zhi.

51:41.320 --> 51:44.160
What's the matter?
Do I know your sweetheart?

51:45.840 --> 51:46.880
Maybe

51:48.200 --> 51:50.040
I know your sweetheart.

51:50.120 --> 51:52.200
I don't even know I have a sweetheart.

51:52.280 --> 51:53.680
The son of Huaixiang's magistrate,

51:55.120 --> 51:56.240
Xue Zhao.
